      abstract: >-
        SciNetX is a Python-based platform for bibliometric, scientometric, and network analysis of scientific literature. It supports
        end-to-end workflows for literature ingestion, cleaning, analysis, and visualization across citation, co-authorship, keyword, institutional, and related research networks
        for reproducible research analytics. It can also be applied to
        custom datasets with or without associated literature papers,
        including broader general network analysis workflows.
